---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Redmond Guide" description="The local's guide to Redmond, Oregon.">
	<h1 style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Redmond</h1>
	<p style="font-style: italic; color: #2D4F3E; border-left: 4px solid #2D4F3E; padding-left: 15px; font-size: 1.2rem;">
		"The Hub of Central Oregon—where the sun always seems to find a way through."
	</p>
	<section style="margin-top: 40px; background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e5e1d8; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
		<h2>Local Intel</h2>
		<p>We are currently building out guides for the Dry Canyon, Smith Rock access, and the best low-key spots in downtown Redmond.</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
